1
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:21,920
Yoo-shin!

2
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:28,440
Yoo-shin, wait up!

3
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:34,760
Yoo-shin, slow down. I can't keep up.

4
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:41,720
Yoo-shin!

5
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,160
Yoo-shin, don't be scared. I'm here.

6
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,280
Mommy's here!

7
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:09,320
Emperor moth.

8
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:12,320
Emperor moth.

9
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,239
Emperor moth!

10
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:15,199
Emperor moth!

11
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,320
Sweetheart, no emperor moths this season.

12
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,039
Don't go.

13
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:29,920
Stay.

14
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:31,879
Don't leave me!

15
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:32,959
Where are you going?

16
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:33,880
Stay.

17
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:39,480
Emperor moth!

18
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,560
It's gone.

19
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,280
It's gone.

20
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,440
Sweetheart,

21
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,680
what's that?

22
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,120
Sweetheart!

23
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,600
Sweetheart.

24
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,120
Yoo-shin.

25
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:41,440
Don't hide. Don't scare me, sweetheart.

26
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,120
He Yoo-shin!

27
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:46,880
He Yoo-shin!

28
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,680
He Yoo-shin, where are you?

29
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:02,360
Yoo-shin, come out! Don't scare me!

30
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:09,160
- He Yoo-shin!
- He Yoo-shin!

31
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,000
He Yoo-shin!

32
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,280
Lee Yun.

33
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:18,240
Lee Yun.

34
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,960
How did he disappear?

35
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,640
Lee Yun!

36
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,760
What happened?

37
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,360
It's okay.

38
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:44,520
It's okay.

39
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,279
Excuse me?

40
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:51,759
How long did you search?

41
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:52,880
How much farther?

42
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,999
How long? How far?

43
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,040
Still searching.

44
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,880
Yoo-shin!

45
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,479
<i>Mom.</i>

46
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,560
<i>Wake up.</i>

47
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:42,320
The emperor moth is out.

48
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:49,440
Mom, the emperor moth is out.

49
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,879
<i>Yu-jhen arrives at 4:30.</i>

50
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:18,839
<i>Don't forget to pick her up.</i>

51
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:20,959
<i>See Da-jun at 2:00 for a studio tour.</i>

52
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,920
<i>- Set an alarm. Don't be late.</i>
- Yu-jhen.

53
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,520
<i>- Laundry's in the washer. Hang it.</i>
- To the studio.

54
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:51,080
Don't open your eyes.

55
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:54,880
Look!

56
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,640
You really bought it?

57
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:02,520
I got one for everyone in the family.

58
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:05,480
Not white. Think Yoo-shin will wear it?

59
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:07,999
Leave it to me.

60
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,999
I'll tell him it's our family uniform.

61
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,359
If he wears it,

62
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,479
we'll be able to find him
wherever he goes.

63
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:16,240
<i>We'll always find each other.</i>

64
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:21,000
Can I have Yoo-shin back?

65
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:28,639
MISSING PERSON

66
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:29,599
CONTACT: YUNLEE0312@TBMAIL.COM

67
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:32,680
DATE OF DISAPPEARANCE: FEBRUARY 7, 2022.
DATE POSTED: FEBRUARY 7, 2025.

68
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:42,320
Sister-in-law.

69
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,159
It's okay, I already showed them.

70
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:46,280
No, don't…

71
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,720
Okay, I'll wait for you here.

72
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,720
Okay, bye.

73
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:58,439
The clients loved the location
and the natural light.

74
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,479
Not to mention, the space is so clean--

75
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:02,559
Yoo-shin is allergic to dust mites.

76
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:04,999
Must keep this place spotless,

77
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:07,760
or he'll sneeze the moment he walks in.

78
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:12,080
He comes straight here after school
to draw.

79
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:15,560
Then he goes home when he's done.

80
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:32,079
Sorry, did I cut you off again?

81
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,239
No.

82
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:35,319
They loved it.

83
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:40,320
They just thought the space
was a little too small for them.

84
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,840
Don't worry.

85
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:44,960
I'll get new clients soon.

86
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:47,519
I'm okay. No rush. Really.

87
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:48,560
Sister-in-law…

88
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:51,800
he's in a hurry.

89
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:57,919
You have a year left on the lease.

90
00:12:57,920 --> 00:13:00,800
Leaving it empty is, honestly, a waste.

91
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,400
If you can

92
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:07,840
pack things up,

93
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,320
it'll look bigger

94
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:12,680
and be easier to rent.

95
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:16,959
<i>Dinner's ready.</i>

96
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:19,119
Wait. I'm not hungry yet.

97
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,920
Let's eat. Don't wait for Mom.

98
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:26,200
Only she eats the spicy one.

99
00:13:26,760 --> 00:13:27,840
Just wait.

100
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,120
She's back.

101
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:44,280
Sorry, I'm late.

102
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:50,079
Da-jun was showing a client around.
I'll give him the keys after--

103
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:51,480
Why no keys?

104
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,359
I left them on the cabinet.

105
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:55,400
Didn't see them?

106
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:59,800
- I didn't notice--
- You forgot the time too.

107
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:04,799
I told you to pick up Yu-jhen.
You forgot that.

108
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:07,679
How long would she have waited
if I had not gone?

109
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:09,800
- I can get home on my own--
- Don't interrupt.

110
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:11,960
I left you a message,

111
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:14,560
and you forgot everything.

112
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:18,240
It's three years today.

113
00:14:22,560 --> 00:14:24,840
I saw the emperor moth emerge.

114
00:14:26,680 --> 00:14:28,360
Yoo-shin saw one

115
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:31,880
the day he went missing,

116
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:34,640
but it shouldn't have been there.

117
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:37,680
The moth must have taken him.

118
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:41,159
That's why I wanted
to set it free in the mountains.

119
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:42,960
- Maybe--
- Maybe you'd see Yoo-shin?

120
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:44,879
Did you?

121
00:14:44,880 --> 00:14:45,960
Did you find him?

122
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,159
No.

123
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:56,080
After three years?
He can't still be there.

124
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:02,760
I never asked you to help me find him.

125
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:06,639
Just don't stop me looking.

126
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:07,559
Fine.

127
00:15:07,560 --> 00:15:10,040
Go wherever you want,
but let me ask you something.

128
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:14,320
Yu-jhen starts school next Tuesday.

129
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:17,919
Her exam is in May. Did you know that?

130
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:18,839
Dad!

131
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,559
You don't care about Yu-jhen.

132
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:22,519
You only look for Yoo-shin.

133
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:23,559
Does it even matter?

134
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:27,760
He'd still be here
if you hadn't taken him, right?

135
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:31,960
Mom!

136
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:38,000
Why would you say that to her?

137
00:15:39,920 --> 00:15:41,600
Why do you always do this?

138
00:15:58,640 --> 00:15:59,760
We're done eating.

139
00:16:08,040 --> 00:16:09,240
I'll do the dishes.

140
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:15,680
I said eat,

141
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:17,880
not do the dishes.

142
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:20,240
I'm not hungry.

143
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:22,120
I'll do the dishes.

144
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:41,600
Great.

145
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:44,960
Come on, one more.

146
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:56,559
It's okay. Yoo-shin. Look at me.

147
00:16:56,560 --> 00:16:58,240
<i>It's okay, Yoo-shin…</i>

148
00:16:59,160 --> 00:17:01,439
<i>You can't…</i>

149
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:04,078
<i>Okay. Look at me.</i>

150
00:17:04,079 --> 00:17:06,720
I've been through this too.

151
00:17:07,839 --> 00:17:10,119
All right, come here…

152
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:13,319
Look at me…

153
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:18,838
It's okay.

154
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:21,000
We'll start over.

155
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,680
I've been through this too.

156
00:17:24,480 --> 00:17:26,400
<i>Hello? Mom, what is it?</i>

157
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:30,120
<i>Really?</i>

158
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:32,160
<i>Okay.</i>

159
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:35,160
<i>Grandparents will be home for Christmas.</i>

160
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,720
<i>No, I was talking to Yoo-shin.</i>

161
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:40,639
<i>Yoo-shin?</i>

162
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:42,119
<i>Great.</i>

163
00:17:42,120 --> 00:17:44,159
<i>Yoo-shin, he's improving daily.</i>

164
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:45,239
<i>Good job.</i>

165
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:47,799
<i>- Good job, Yoo-shin.
- When are you coming?</i>

166
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:49,120
<i>I'll book your hotel.</i>

167
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:52,119
<i>Why book a hotel? Stay at home.</i>

168
00:17:52,120 --> 00:17:54,080
<i>Jian-cheng said to stay with us.</i>

169
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:58,120
<i>So sweet.</i>

170
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:02,160
<i>Put this…</i>

171
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:04,440
<i>- Right here.
- Okay.</i>

172
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:06,360
<i>Wash it first.</i>

173
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:22,000
<i>Dad's taking you back to Taipei tomorrow.</i>

174
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:30,160
I'm sorry

175
00:18:31,520 --> 00:18:33,520
I didn't spend more time with you.

176
00:18:34,560 --> 00:18:37,280
I'm not a kid. I can look after myself.

177
00:18:47,120 --> 00:18:48,480
Next time,

178
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:52,240
I won't leave you alone. Okay?

179
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:55,560
No way.

180
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:57,600
People will tease me.

181
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:00,040
So what?

182
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:03,160
You're my baby.

183
00:19:08,320 --> 00:19:09,400
Mom,

184
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:12,680
please listen to Dad.

185
00:19:13,800 --> 00:19:15,440
Don't go to the mountain.

186
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:20,359
We worry every time you do.

187
00:19:20,360 --> 00:19:22,000
Dad worries about you.

188
00:19:23,080 --> 00:19:23,920
And…

189
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:26,840
he's gone.

190
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:35,040
- He's still alive.
- Mom…

191
00:19:36,360 --> 00:19:37,680
he's dead.

192
00:19:45,280 --> 00:19:46,440
Yoo-shin is alive.

193
00:19:48,720 --> 00:19:50,120
I know it.

194
00:21:45,600 --> 00:21:46,720
What are you doing?

195
00:21:47,840 --> 00:21:49,199
Why are you still awake?

196
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:52,800
I heard a child's laughter and footsteps.

197
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:55,040
Didn't you hear it?

198
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:56,520
No.

199
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:58,399
How?

200
00:21:58,400 --> 00:22:00,199
It was so clear. You didn't hear it?

201
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:02,240
Why are you still up? Can't sleep?

202
00:22:04,040 --> 00:22:05,600
Have some warm milk.

203
00:22:10,040 --> 00:22:11,240
Hey, wait.

204
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:13,400
Why go to the basement?

205
00:22:14,080 --> 00:22:15,200
Take a pill

206
00:22:15,760 --> 00:22:17,280
and go to bed.

207
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,440
I don't want meds.

208
00:22:50,520 --> 00:22:52,320
Call me if there's anything.

209
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:57,079
Don't go wandering off.

210
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:58,599
Keep your phone on.

211
00:22:58,600 --> 00:22:59,760
Okay, I will.

212
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:02,520
Give me a hug.

213
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:04,680
No.

214
00:23:05,280 --> 00:23:06,320
No?

215
00:23:08,680 --> 00:23:09,840
Be good.

216
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:14,240
- Bye.
- Okay, get in.

217
00:24:53,560 --> 00:24:54,560
<i>Hello?</i>

218
00:24:55,240 --> 00:24:56,680
Hello, Jian-cheng?

219
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:58,680
<i>What is it?</i>

220
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:02,640
I…

221
00:25:03,200 --> 00:25:05,199
<i>Speak. What is it?</i>

222
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:06,360
I just saw…

223
00:25:08,680 --> 00:25:09,680
<i>What did you see?</i>

224
00:25:14,800 --> 00:25:15,920
<i>Li Yun,</i>

225
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:18,600
<i>say something.</i>

226
00:25:20,600 --> 00:25:21,560
<i>Li Yun.</i>

227
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:28,320
I… I saw…

228
00:25:29,760 --> 00:25:31,160
I saw the mirror crack.

229
00:25:36,720 --> 00:25:38,120
Should I come back now?

230
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:41,519
<i>No…</i>

231
00:25:41,520 --> 00:25:43,479
<i>You have work tomorrow.</i>

232
00:25:43,480 --> 00:25:45,400
<i>It's okay. Don't come back.</i>

233
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,040
Hello?

234
00:25:50,040 --> 00:25:51,080
Li Yun?

235
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:20,400
<i>I thought time would heal her.</i>

236
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:23,360
She keeps going back and forth.

237
00:26:24,080 --> 00:26:25,280
It's worse lately.

238
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:30,159
Don't worry.

239
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:32,640
With your support, she'll get better.

240
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:38,839
We bought this for Yoo-shin.

241
00:26:38,840 --> 00:26:40,719
Better air,

242
00:26:40,720 --> 00:26:42,160
more space,

243
00:26:43,360 --> 00:26:45,280
a better place to learn.

244
00:26:47,160 --> 00:26:49,080
Everything was for him.

245
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:53,120
<i>Last night,</i>

246
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:56,320
I saw my double in the mirror.

247
00:26:57,080 --> 00:26:58,880
She looked exactly like me.

248
00:26:59,720 --> 00:27:03,080
I know she wasn't me.

249
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:06,640
Then she vanished.

250
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:13,560
Do you think maybe you were just tired
and made a mistake?

251
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:16,120
I'm not sure.

252
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:21,079
My memory hasn't been great lately.

253
00:27:21,080 --> 00:27:23,679
I'm the one who puts everything away,

254
00:27:23,680 --> 00:27:26,319
but when I need something,
I can't find it.

255
00:27:26,320 --> 00:27:29,519
I get so anxious when that happens.

256
00:27:29,520 --> 00:27:31,119
But I don't want to take…

257
00:27:31,120 --> 00:27:33,199
I don't want to take those pills.

258
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:35,320
Don't worry. Relax.

259
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:39,200
Let's review your records first.

260
00:27:42,040 --> 00:27:45,880
You said you'd teach art
after stopping your meds.

261
00:27:46,760 --> 00:27:48,160
Are you still teaching?

262
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:50,760
No.

263
00:27:52,760 --> 00:27:54,480
Fewer kids are coming now,

264
00:27:56,360 --> 00:27:59,319
and Jian-cheng
wants to give up the studio,

265
00:27:59,320 --> 00:28:01,680
but I don't want to.

266
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:05,080
Did you tell him?

267
00:28:09,760 --> 00:28:12,759
No. I don't know how to tell him.

268
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:14,600
I lost Yoo-shin.

269
00:28:17,480 --> 00:28:19,200
He still blames me.

270
00:28:19,800 --> 00:28:22,360
He's right. It was my fault.

271
00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:25,240
How can he act like nothing happened?

272
00:28:25,960 --> 00:28:27,800
How can he act like nothing happened?

273
00:28:36,880 --> 00:28:38,040
If we were in Taipei,

274
00:28:38,960 --> 00:28:40,400
we'd have found him

275
00:28:42,080 --> 00:28:43,360
on camera.

276
00:28:52,080 --> 00:28:53,360
How's the market now?

277
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,480
What's our house worth?

278
00:28:56,880 --> 00:28:59,159
You thinking of selling it?

279
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:00,480
If the price is right.

280
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:02,840
I'll check for you.

281
00:29:07,960 --> 00:29:10,719
<i>Don't blame yourself for everything.</i>

282
00:29:10,720 --> 00:29:14,680
You need to forgive yourself first.
That's how you'll get better.

283
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:20,080
We'll figure this out together.

284
00:29:20,880 --> 00:29:23,280
<i>Bring your husband next time, okay?</i>

285
00:29:24,080 --> 00:29:25,400
<i>No way.</i>

286
00:29:25,920 --> 00:29:27,160
<i>No.</i>

287
00:29:27,960 --> 00:29:29,800
<i>He thinks I'm the problem.</i>

288
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:32,679
<i>He thinks I'm the one who's sick.</i>

289
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:34,440
<i>Okay, no pressure.</i>

290
00:29:36,440 --> 00:29:38,200
<i>I know you hate taking meds,</i>

291
00:29:38,920 --> 00:29:42,480
<i>but stabilizing your
condition is our top priority.</i>

292
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:46,679
<i>So I'll write you a week's prescription.</i>

293
00:29:46,680 --> 00:29:48,399
<i>Take them on time,</i>

294
00:29:48,400 --> 00:29:51,320
<i>and we'll schedule
our next counseling session.</i>

295
00:30:32,520 --> 00:30:34,919
Sorry to wake you up, sister-in-law.

296
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:35,919
No.

297
00:30:35,920 --> 00:30:37,640
I was about to get up anyway.

298
00:30:39,280 --> 00:30:40,320
What's up?

299
00:30:45,720 --> 00:30:48,159
Don't bother, sister-in-law.
I'm not staying long.

300
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:49,160
It's okay.

301
00:30:53,400 --> 00:30:55,720
When did he tell you
he was selling the house?

302
00:30:57,080 --> 00:30:58,320
A couple of days ago.

303
00:30:59,320 --> 00:31:02,400
He just asked for an estimate,
not a definite sale.

304
00:31:20,920 --> 00:31:24,320
Don't take a photo of the mirror
in the bathroom.

305
00:31:25,040 --> 00:31:26,040
The mirror?

306
00:31:26,600 --> 00:31:27,840
What's wrong with it?

307
00:31:57,120 --> 00:31:58,120
It's completely fine.

308
00:32:56,760 --> 00:32:59,160
- Hi, Mrs. He.
- Xiaoqi.

309
00:33:00,920 --> 00:33:02,880
Why are you in Yu-jhen's room?

310
00:33:03,600 --> 00:33:04,840
How did you get in?

311
00:33:07,080 --> 00:33:09,120
I came to get my headphones.

312
00:33:09,880 --> 00:33:12,920
Yu-jhen gave me the code
so I wouldn't wake you.

313
00:33:20,080 --> 00:33:21,520
Were you here

314
00:33:22,280 --> 00:33:23,240
Friday night?

315
00:33:29,120 --> 00:33:30,800
You saw Yu-jhen at midnight?

316
00:33:38,880 --> 00:33:39,960
Awesome.

317
00:34:00,720 --> 00:34:02,880
Mrs. He, sorry for waking you again.

318
00:34:04,320 --> 00:34:05,480
I'll get going.

319
00:34:07,760 --> 00:34:08,920
Good night.

320
00:34:23,199 --> 00:34:24,280
I'm not sick.

321
00:34:27,280 --> 00:34:28,639
I'm not hearing things.

322
00:34:30,040 --> 00:34:31,480
I'm not hallucinating.

323
00:34:32,639 --> 00:34:33,760
I'm not.

324
00:36:48,080 --> 00:36:49,280
Mom?

325
00:38:21,120 --> 00:38:23,120
How are you there, Yoo-shin?

326
00:38:24,080 --> 00:38:25,760
How are you there, Yoo-shin?

327
00:38:26,720 --> 00:38:27,800
Mom!

328
00:38:29,440 --> 00:38:30,480
Mom!

329
00:38:31,120 --> 00:38:32,200
What is it?

330
00:38:45,600 --> 00:38:47,959
No! Don't shut the door!

331
00:38:47,960 --> 00:38:50,720
No! Where are you going? Where?

332
00:38:57,840 --> 00:39:01,160
MOM
CALLING

333
00:39:13,200 --> 00:39:14,519
- Hello?
<i>- Yu-jhen.</i>

334
00:39:14,520 --> 00:39:17,120
- Mom.
<i>- I just saw Yoo-shin.</i>

335
00:39:19,040 --> 00:39:21,800
Mom, do you know what time it is?

336
00:39:23,480 --> 00:39:27,520
<i>I'm serious. I saw Yoo-shin.
He looks exactly the same.</i>

337
00:39:28,880 --> 00:39:30,959
<i>Mom, please go to bed.</i>

338
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:33,200
Why don't you believe me?

339
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:37,120
<i>Where did you see him?</i>

340
00:39:37,760 --> 00:39:38,920
<i>In a dream?</i>

341
00:39:39,880 --> 00:39:42,640
I wasn't dreaming. I…

342
00:39:46,080 --> 00:39:47,760
I saw him in the mirror.

343
00:39:48,400 --> 00:39:49,920
The mirror in my room.

344
00:39:53,280 --> 00:39:54,240
<i>In the mirror?</i>

345
00:39:55,280 --> 00:39:57,120
<i>In the mirror? How?</i>

346
00:39:58,560 --> 00:40:00,120
Why is it so foggy?

347
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:04,640
<i>- Hello?</i>
- My car is gone.

348
00:40:05,920 --> 00:40:07,920
<i>Mom, what are you saying?</i>

349
00:40:30,080 --> 00:40:31,120
Hello?

350
00:40:32,040 --> 00:40:33,120
Hello?

351
00:40:41,760 --> 00:40:44,759
<i>Your call has been sent to voicemail.</i>

352
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:46,880
YU-JHEN
CALLING
